---
import ProviderLogo from "../../console/ProviderLogo.astro";
---

<div class="onboarding-step-pane" data-step-pane="connect">
  <!-- 3D Hero Banner -->
  <div class="step-hero-card">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="hero-step-pill">BƯỚC 4 / 5</span>
      <h2>Kết nối Cổng Thanh toán & Kênh Phân phối</h2>
      <p>Liên kết cổng thanh toán VietQR (PayOS) và Bot Telegram tự động để tiền về thẳng tài khoản ngân hàng của bạn.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image-wrap">
      <img src="/illustrations/onboarding-connect.jpg" alt="" class="hero-illustration" width="130" height="130" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="connect-sections-stack">
    <!-- Section 1: PayOS (VietQR) -->
    <section class="connect-card payos-card">
      <div class="connect-card-header">
        <div class="connect-title-icon">
          <div class="provider-logo-container">
            <ProviderLogo name="payos" size={32} />
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="title-with-badge">
              <h3>Cổng Thanh Toán VietQR (PayOS)</h3>
              <span class="partner-pill">Chính Thức</span>
            </div>
            <p>Khách quét mã QR ngân hàng tự động, tiền về thẳng STK cá nhân/doanh nghiệp của bạn sau 1 giây.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="connection-status-pill" data-payos-status-pill data-status="unlinked">Chưa kết nối</span>
      </div>

      <div class="connect-guide-box">
        <strong>Hướng dẫn kết nối nhanh:</strong>
        <ol>
          <li>Đăng nhập <a href="https://payos.vn" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">payos.vn ↗</a> và tạo <em>Kênh thanh toán</em> mới.</li>
          <li>Sao chép 3 thông số: <code>Client ID</code>, <code>API Key</code>, <code>Checksum Key</code> và dán vào dưới đây:</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <form class="credential-form-grid" data-payos-form novalidate>
        <div class="form-group full-width">
          <label for="payos-client-id">Client ID <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
          <input id="payos-client-id" name="clientId" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="d827f8a1-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx" required data-input-payos-client-id />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="payos-api-key">API Key <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
          <input id="payos-api-key" name="apiKey" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="c394d21e-xxxx-xxxx" required data-input-payos-api-key />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="payos-checksum-key">Checksum Key <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
          <input id="payos-checksum-key" name="checksumKey" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="8b91a74e-xxxx-xxxx" required data-input-payos-checksum-key />
        </div>
        <div class="connect-form-actions full-width">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-verify-connect" data-btn-verify-payos>
            <span>Xác thực & Kích hoạt PayOS</span>
          </button>
          <p class="crypto-note">Khóa bí mật được mã hóa AES-256-GCM tại D1, an toàn tuyệt đối.</p>
        </div>
      </form>
      <button type="button" class="btn-card-skip" data-card-skip="payos">Chưa có tài khoản PayOS — để sau</button>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2: Telegram Bot -->
    <section class="connect-card telegram-card" data-telegram-connect-section>
      <div class="connect-card-header">
        <div class="connect-title-icon">
          <div class="provider-logo-container">
            <ProviderLogo name="telegram" size={32} />
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="title-with-badge">
              <h3>Bot Bán Hàng Telegram</h3>
              <span class="telegram-pill">24/7 Tự Động</span>
            </div>
            <p>Tự động gửi danh mục sản phẩm, tạo mã QR và giao key tức thì trong tin nhắn riêng với khách hàng.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="connection-status-pill" data-telegram-status-pill data-status="unlinked">Chưa kết nối</span>
      </div>

      <div class="connect-guide-box">
        <strong>Hướng dẫn tạo bot trong 1 phút:</strong>
        <ol>
          <li>Mở Telegram, tìm bot <a href="https://t.me/BotFather" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@BotFather ↗</a> và gửi lệnh <code>/newbot</code>.</li>
          <li>Đặt tên và username cho bot, sau đó sao chép <code>HTTP API Token</code> dán vào ô dưới:</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <form class="credential-form-grid" data-telegram-form novalidate>
        <div class="form-group full-width">
          <label for="telegram-bot-token">HTTP API Token của Bot <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
          <input id="telegram-bot-token" name="botToken" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="1234567890:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrsTUVwxyz" required data-input-telegram-token />
        </div>
        <div class="connect-form-actions full-width">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-verify-connect" data-btn-verify-telegram>
            <span>Kết nối Bot & Cài đặt Webhook</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <button type="button" class="btn-card-skip" data-card-skip="telegram">Chưa tạo bot — để sau</button>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="step-actions split-actions full-width">
    <button type="button" class="btn-secondary-back" data-step-back="inventory">
      ← Quay lại
    </button>
    <div class="right-actions">
      <button type="button" class="btn-skip-link" data-step-skip="connect">
        Kết nối sau
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="btn-primary-launch" data-step-submit="connect">
        <span>Xem Lại & Mở Bán Cửa Hàng 🚀</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .onboarding-step-pane {
    display: none;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .onboarding-step-pane.is-active {
    display: flex;
  }

  /* 3D Hero Card */
  .step-hero-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    border-radius: var(--sln-console-radius-container, 16px);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #F5F3FF 100%);
    border: 2px solid var(--sln-soft-border);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(124, 106, 240, 0.06);
  }

  .hero-content {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .hero-step-pill {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--sln-console-radius-pill, 999px);
    background: var(--sln-soft-accent);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .hero-content h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 24px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #101828;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero-content p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #475467;
  }

  .hero-image-wrap {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .hero-illustration {
    border-radius: 12px;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(124, 106, 240, 0.12);
  }

  /* Connect Sections Stack */
  .connect-sections-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .connect-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 2px solid var(--sln-soft-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.04);
  }

  .connect-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .connect-title-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .provider-logo-container {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .title-with-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }

  .title-with-badge h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #101828;
  }

  .partner-pill {
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #DCFCE7;
    color: #15803D;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .telegram-pill {
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #E0F2FE;
    color: #0369A1;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .connect-title-icon p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #475467;
  }

  .connection-status-pill {
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
    background: #F2F4F7;
    color: #475467;
  }

  .connection-status-pill[data-status="connected"] {
    background: #DCFCE7;
    color: #15803D;
  }

  /* Guide Box */
  .connect-guide-box {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 2px solid var(--sln-soft-border);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #344054;
  }

  .connect-guide-box ol {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    padding-inline-start: 20px;
  }

  .connect-guide-box a {
    color: var(--sln-soft-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .connect-guide-box code {
    background: #EEF2F6;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11.5px;
  }

  /* Credential Form Grid */
  .credential-form-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .form-group.full-width {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #344054;
  }

  .required-star {
    color: #E02424;
  }

  input {
    width: 100%;
    border: 2px solid var(--sln-soft-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #101828;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--sln-soft-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124, 106, 240, 0.15);
  }

  .connect-form-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .btn-verify-connect {
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #101828;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: none;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-verify-connect:hover {
    background: #1D2939;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .crypto-note {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #0E9F6E;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .btn-card-skip {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: #667085;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Actions */
  .step-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .split-actions {
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .right-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .btn-skip-link {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: #667085;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-secondary-back {
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid var(--sln-soft-border);
    color: #344054;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-secondary-back:hover {
    background: #F9FAFB;
    border-color: #98A2B3;
  }

  .btn-primary-launch {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 12px 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sln-soft-accent) 0%, #4338CA 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: none;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(124, 106, 240, 0.35);
    transition: all 0.18s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary-launch:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(124, 106, 240, 0.45);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .step-hero-card {
      flex-direction: column-reverse;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 16px;
    }

    .hero-step-pill {
      align-self: center;
    }

    .credential-form-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .connect-card-header {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
